<title>MEXICO: Tribasa says not to bid in rail auction.</title>
<headline>Tribasa says not to bid in rail auction.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican construction company Grupo Tribasa will not bid in the auction for the concession to operate the Pacific North rail, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;Tribasa has decided to concentrate on its main markets in which it is a specialist; therefore, it wishes to inform its withdrawal from the bidding process for the concession to operate the Pacific North line of the national railway network,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>((--Jacqueline Lerma, Monterrey bureau +528 345-7677))</p>
</text>
